            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taran Refugee",
        "text": "Leave your account book alone already. What, gonna wait a few days, and then go selling stuff out of your boot again?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fionn",
        "text": "No, that's never happening. *sigh*"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fionn",
        "text": "But just, whenever I do something shameful, I feel the need to make a note."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_242",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taran Refugee",
        "text": "The doctor's a smart sort\u2014she knew how you'd gotten hurt on first blush, even. If she's not blaming you, that's because she forgives you."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fionn",
        "text": "But she said, she wasn't a doctor. She just learned a little first-aid working someplace where they sell medicine. That's how she led us through treating our wounds..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_242",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taran Refugee",
        "text": "How do you know she's telling the truth?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_242",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taran Refugee",
        "text": "If you ask me? She's not your normal doctor, no, but there's no chance she's just some pharmacy worker. She had a full suite of medicine with her, out here in the wastes. That, that's strange."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_242",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taran Refugee",
        "text": "Oh, yeah, and did you see what she had in that box of hers? You're a business type. Got a guess on how much it was worth?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fionn",
        "text": "I didn't look properly."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_725_1#4$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fionn",
        "text": "You can't be thinking of stealing luggage from the person who saved us."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_242",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taran Refugee",
        "text": "No, no, I'm just asking."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fionn",
        "text": "*sigh*... Got any more bread there?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_242",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taran Refugee",
        "text": "Not much."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fionn",
        "text": "Give me a little, for God's sakes."
    },
