    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fionn",
        "text": "Doctor."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fionn",
        "text": "Er, no, sorry, I know you don't like being called that... um, you want some bread?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reed",
        "text": "No, thank you."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fionn",
        "text": "What are you reading there?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reed",
        "text": "It's just... an old Taran poetry collection."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_725_1#8$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fionn",
        "text": "Oh, oh, it's in Taran... I never knew much Taran, see. Even less so when it's written, I suppose, haha."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reed",
        "text": "If you want to sit down here, I won't mind."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "text": "Alright, er...",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_725_1#8$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "text": "Actually, I've been meaning to thank you for last night.",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reed",
        "text": "All I did was give you some medicine."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reed",
        "text": "They're things I ought to do, cleaning wounds, bandaging. But I\u2014still can't do them that well."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_725_1#2$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fionn",
        "text": "That's fine, I didn't even dare touch the wound myself. Scared the living daylights."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fionn",
        "text": "What I wanted to say was, if you hadn't set that fire off, we might never have escaped."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#6$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reed",
        "text": "Fire...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#8$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reed",
        "text": "No, the fire wasn't me. I was just passing by."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fionn",
        "text": "Okay. If you say so, then it must've been a coincidence."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fionn",
        "text": "Ah, Dublinn my arse. Those army lot'll call anyone who disobeys them Dublinn. We're a lost cause, but good people like you, you shouldn't have to bear such heavy guilt."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reed",
        "text": "Do you hate Dublinn, very much?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_725_1#2$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fionn",
        "text": "I... I couldn't say."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fionn",
        "text": "I'll give you a word of warning, seeing as you're from the city. For the past while, Dublinn's people have been around these parts."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fionn",
        "text": "I hear they ran into one lot of Victoria's army, and not a single of those Victorians survived."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fionn",
        "text": "That upset the lords of the city fierce, so they transferred in a whole thing of soldiers to Trent, seizing people all over the Sc\u00e1thanna Fields. Burnt several villages down too."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fionn",
        "text": "You really shouldn't have saved us, truth be told. We're not worth it."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reed",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reed",
        "text": "If I don't\u2014care for other people's lives, then I won't have achieved\u2014what I agreed with Rhodes Island..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_725_1#4$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fionn",
        "text": "Eh? Sorry, you're talking a little too quiet, actually..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reed",
        "text": "No, it's nothing... I'm already aware of\u2014some of what you've told me. I'll be careful on the way."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_725_1#4$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fionn",
        "text": "Er, you're going now?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reed",
        "text": "Mm. It's day now. I won't need you to show me the way."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fionn",
        "text": "Alright, alright. I understand. Tarans like your sort, speaking Victorian so finely, I know you don't like to talk with us much."
    },
