        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe",
        "text": "Oh, we've got signal here? Doesn't that mean we went the wrong direction again?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Looks like it. The comms facilities around here haven't been destroyed, which indicates they haven't advanced upon these parts."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe",
        "text": "Hmm... any word from Rhodes Island, then?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Basically the same as what the news says. Arson committed by a small group of Dublinn soldiers in Redridge village last night, burning down a building in the barracks."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "But said soldiers don't seem to have fled into these barrens."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "The rest is all invalid info. It just so happens every nomadic city been far from these barrens for the past month. Our field operators haven't reported anything unusual."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "While we've only seen what mark the battles have left behind... and we can't even determine the scale of those battles from it."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "We can only tell one thing. There was a massive disparity between the two sides' power. It seems they made short work of that whole unit of Victorian soldiers."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_662_1#3$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Bagpipe, are you listening?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe",
        "text": "Eh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_662_1#6$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Your parts are installed in the wrong orientations. I can tell you're getting distracted again."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe",
        "text": "Wow, Chenchen, I didn't know you knew piledriver spear assembly too! It took me forever studyin' to actually remember how you maintain one."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "I never fully got my head around the assembly."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe",
        "text": "I was just thinkin', why does Hughes always sound like somebody else in his letters? I know it doesn't make much sense bringin' it up, but..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_662_1#8$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "That's fine. I've always trusted your intuition to be on the mark."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "You feel like there's always something he wants to say, but doesn't dare to?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_662_1#7$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Just like how last time we went to see him, it was like he was being watched."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe",
        "text": "Aye, that's exactly it!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "That proves we're not on the wrong track. The intel Hughes gave us was accurate\u2014enough so to put the enemy on guard."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_662_1#7$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "The army can hide their march route, but there's some leaked hint of how raw materials are flowing for war purposes. Over the past few months, the few Dublinn units we've marked have all converged on this area."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe",
        "text": "The outer parts of Trent? This... uninhabited zone?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe",
        "text": "Chenchen, you look like you've seen a..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Three o'clock."
    },
