            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe",
        "text": "Oh. They're just a few of them. It's like they're standin' guard... Are they bait?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "No, not necessarily. They're reminding me of... some things that happened in Lungmen."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Don't underestimate them. We'll approach carefully."
